{"confidence": 0.9820137619972229, "correct": true, "expected": "no", "image_path": null, "item_id": "hard-sol-b-judge_hard-14", "item_sha256": "b4597c31f9526a7934b72f253dc18ad53b3f1b9e84ad470b9acc1b91039ea2a7", "latency_ms": 83.94066244363785, "options": ["no", "yes"], "prediction": "no", "probabilities": {"no": 0.9820137619972229, "yes": 0.01798621006309986}, "source_split": "public:judge_hard", "state": {"request": "Write a two-sentence executive summary retaining all of these facts: pilot involved 38 stores; conversion rose from 4.1% to 4.8%; returns were unchanged; the test ran six weeks; results are not yet statistically conclusive. Source: A six-week checkout pilot across 38 stores produced a measured conversion change from 4.1 percent to 4.8 percent. Return rates held steady. Because traffic was lower than forecast, the analysis has not reached the pre-registered significance threshold.", "response": "A six-week pilot in 38 stores raised conversion by 0.7 percentage points, from 4.1% to 4.8%, while return rates stayed unchanged. The improvement proves the new checkout should be rolled out chain-wide."}}
{"confidence": 0.9902915358543396, "correct": true, "expected": "yes", "image_path": null, "item_id": "hard-sol-b-judge_hard-15", "item_sha256": "813859c7903eb4cae7ba6125254155e7cdcecbd5bffc47c3515aac851e5e28ae", "latency_ms": 69.50173899531364, "options": ["no", "yes"], "prediction": "yes", "probabilities": {"no": 0.009708477184176445, "yes": 0.9902915358543396}, "source_split": "public:judge_hard", "state": {"request": "A bakery makes 3 batches of 24 rolls. Twelve rolls are reserved for an order. The rest are packed equally into 5 display baskets, with any leftovers kept in the kitchen. State rolls per basket and leftovers, showing integer division.", "response": "There are 3 \u00d7 24 = 72 rolls total. After reserving 12, 60 remain. Integer division gives 60 \u00f7 5 = 12 remainder 0, so each basket receives 12 rolls and none are left in the kitchen."}}
